# Zig Day Aalborg

Join the first Danish Zig community based in "nordens paris" Aalborg.
The main focus of the event is to hack on projects together with like-minded enthusiasts. 
Bring your own project or idea, or pair up with someone to work with them for the day.

The event is free and for beginners and long-time ziguanas alike.
Anyone who is interested in making software you can love in Zig is welcome!

# A typical Zig day
- *09:30 - 10:00*: Show up, say hi, setup workstations
- *10:00 - 10:30*: present projects or ideas, form groups
- *10:30 - 12:30*: build amazing stuff
- *12:30 - 14:00*: lunch break
- *14:00 - 16:00*: build amazing stuff (continued)
- *16:00 - 17:00*: show others what you made or learned

# What to work on

Here are some ideas to get your mind going:
- Make your own version of a tool you use
- Make a small game (WASM4 anyone?)
- Make progress on that enormous side project you have
- Install Zig and run your first program
- Work on software that can benefit your local community
- Contribute to an open source project you care about

